        "SRC005737"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "SEC056",
      "title": "Hands as Doorways",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "We were speaking of the stripes of Jesus, and how those stripes were the veil. The veil of his flesh was torn, and through that tearing we have access in. It is through that same opening that heaven is released outward, through the hands.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA214",
            "SRC005845",
            "SRC005846",
            "SRC005876",
            "SRC005878",
            "SRC005879"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC005845",
            "SRC005846",
            "SRC005876",
            "SRC005878",
            "SRC005879",
            "SRC005900",
            "SRC005918",
            "SRC005935"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA214"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [
            "UNC025"
          ],
          "paragraph_id": "P000009",
          "provider_handle": "p9"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hebrews chapter 10 was referenced in connection with this access through the torn veil.",
          "kind": "connective",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "REF017",
            "SRC002194",
            "SRC002197"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC002194",
            "SRC002197"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [
            "REF017"
          ],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000010",
          "provider_handle": "p10"
        },
        {
          "text": "It was said that our hands are doors, through which the light flows. During a time of fellowship within a twenty-one day fast, I saw doors in the hands of the singer standing to the side. The door was open, and I saw something like the color of the sky.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA215",
            "EX035",
            "SRC005852",
            "SRC005853",
            "SRC005860",
            "SRC005862",
            "SRC005868",
            "SRC005869",
            "SRC005886",
            "SRC005900"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC005852",
            "SRC005853",
            "SRC005860",
            "SRC005862",
            "SRC005868",
            "SRC005869",
            "SRC005886",
            "SRC005900",
            "SRC005918",
            "SRC005935"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA215"
          ],
          "example_refs": [
            "EX035"
          ],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [
            "UNC025"
          ],
          "paragraph_id": "P000011",
          "provider_handle": "p11"
        },
        {
          "text": "It was not entirely clear in the exchange who among those present was recounting this, since several voices spoke together about the hands and the veil.",
          "kind": "connective",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "SRC005918",
            "SRC005935"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC005918",
            "SRC005935",
            "SRC005900"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [
            "UNC025"
          ],
          "paragraph_id": "P000012",
          "provider_handle": "p12"
        },
        {
          "text": "A second, separate testimony tells of someone who, in his tent, saw a white dust and an opening, a door, colored like the sky. This confirms the same teaching already given, that the hands serve as spiritual doorways.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA216",
            "EX036",
            "SRC005953",
            "SRC005956",
            "SRC005958",
            "SRC005960"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC005953",
            "SRC005956",
            "SRC005958",
            "SRC005960"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA216"
          ],
          "example_refs": [
            "EX036"
          ],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000013",
          "provider_handle": "p13"
        }
      ],
      "idea_refs": [
        "IDEA214",
        "IDEA215",
        "IDEA216"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC005845",
        "SRC005846",
        "SRC005876",
        "SRC005878",
        "SRC005879",
        "SRC005900",
        "SRC005918",
        "SRC005935",
        "SRC002194",
        "SRC002197",
        "SRC005852",
        "SRC005853",
        "SRC005860",
        "SRC005862",
        "SRC005868",
        "SRC005869",
        "SRC005886",
        "SRC005953",
        "SRC005956",
        "SRC005958",
        "SRC005960"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "SEC057",
      "title": "A Holy Man Lacks Nothing",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "If God can do one thing, he can do another. If he can forgive my sins, why would I not believe that he can also heal every disease? Keep it simple.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA217",
            "SRC006058",
            "SRC006059",
            "SRC006061",
            "SRC006062"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006058",
            "SRC006059",
            "SRC006061",
            "SRC006062"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA217"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000014",
          "provider_handle": "p14"
        },
        {
          "text": "A holy man is a powerful person. To be holy means there is nothing missing in you; nothing is lacking. Heaven agrees with you, and the earth agrees with you.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA218",
            "SRC006076",
            "SRC006080",
            "SRC006084",
            "SRC006086",
            "SRC006087"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006076",
            "SRC006080",
            "SRC006084",
            "SRC006086",
            "SRC006087",
            "SRC006090"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA218"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000015",
          "provider_handle": "p15"
        },
        {
          "text": "The powers of darkness do not want to come near a holy man; instead of what holiness carries, they see a cloud of darkness when a soul is unclean. Because the soul is clouded, that darkness repels what holiness would otherwise draw near.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA218",
            "IDEA219",
            "SRC006090",
            "SRC006091",
            "SRC006093",
            "SRC006094"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006090",
            "SRC006091",
            "SRC006093",
            "SRC006094",
            "SRC006076",
            "SRC006080",
            "SRC006084",
            "SRC006086",
            "SRC006087"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA218",
            "IDEA219"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000016",
          "provider_handle": "p16"
        }
      ],
      "idea_refs": [
        "IDEA217",
        "IDEA218",
        "IDEA219"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC006058",
        "SRC006059",
        "SRC006061",
        "SRC006062",
        "SRC006076",
        "SRC006080",
        "SRC006084",
        "SRC006086",
        "SRC006087",
        "SRC006090",
        "SRC006091",
        "SRC006093",
        "SRC006094"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "SEC058",
      "title": "Without Struggle",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "As you grow, you will begin to discover that the gift of the Holy Ghost is powerful, yet it comes without struggle. There is no effort required for its manifestation.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA220",
            "SRC006100",
            "SRC006101",
            "SRC006103",
            "SRC006107"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006100",
            "SRC006101",
            "SRC006103",
            "SRC006107"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA220"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000017",
          "provider_handle": "p17"
        },
        {
          "text": "You will see somebody coming toward you and see his life as though it were a television; you go past the person into his tomorrow, see it, and come back to tell him.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA221",
            "SRC006108",
            "SRC006109",
            "SRC006134"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006108",
            "SRC006109",
            "SRC006134"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA221"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000018",
          "provider_handle": "p18"
        },
        {
          "text": "You begin to live your life out of that overflow once you are in communion with the Spirit; it becomes simply a way of life.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA222",
            "SRC006113",
            "SRC006114"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006113",
            "SRC006114"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA222"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000019",
          "provider_handle": "p19"
        },
        {
          "text": "If you stay in communion, you will never lack for a word of knowledge. Stay in communion with the spirit of wisdom, and you will never lack for a word of wisdom.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA223",
            "SRC006115",
            "SRC006117",
            "SRC006119",
            "SRC006121"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006115",
            "SRC006117",
            "SRC006119",
            "SRC006121"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA223"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000020",
          "provider_handle": "p20"
        }
      ],
